.DS_Store

# Python compiled artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Python virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Zaber stage config: auto-generated by ZaberStage.connect() into the cwd on
# every connect (machine-specific: serial number, firmware, discovered port).
# Regenerable, so not versioned — except the driver's documented template.
zaber_config.json
!Driver_ZaberStage/zaber_config.json

# PlatformIO build output — regenerable; churns on every compile (was tracked,
# which made VS Code Source Control lag / "lose track"). Files stay on disk.
.pio/

# NOTE: experiment session data under */data/ IS tracked on purpose (so results
# are available on other machines). Only .pio build output is ignored above.
